# Runtime guarantees:
# - Deterministic logic is first.
# - Free/open model routing precedes paid escalation.
# - Models cannot manufacture property/review evidence.
# - Destination ranking does not use affiliate commission economics.
# - Raw conversation text is not stored for learning.
